## Workflow summary

1. **Clarify** — ask when ambiguous; read owning code first.
2. **Plan** — per **`plan-creation-contract.mdc`** / **`PLAN_TEMPLATE.md`** for non-trivial work.
3. **Implement** — match conventions; Read triggered domain rules before editing.
4. **Verify** — per **`global-testing-discipline.mdc`** and monitor dual-verify rules.
5. **Close** — per **`plan-completion-gate.mdc`** (Agent rule dispatch → Final code review → Post-implementation review).

If the monitor plan implies consumer changes, add **Consumer follow-up plan** per **monitor-consumer-side-plan** (even when implementing monitor-only in this session).
